SUMMARY:Airport to downtown
DESCRIPTION:Canada Line SkyTrain to Waterfront Station (under 30 min)\, the
 n ~7 min walk to Woodward's W43.\n• Tap a credit card or Apple Pay at th
 e gate — one per adult. Kids ride free.\n• Sit at the very front: ther
 e's no driver\, so the kids get the windshield.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net
 /vancouver/
LOCATION:Waterfront Station\, 601 W Cordova St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Airport to downtown
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
