SUMMARY:Steam Clock\, then a cab to Robson
DESCRIPTION:It's dark by 4:15\, so Water Street is all lights. A quick look
  at the Steam Clock (it whistles every 15 minutes)\, then a 10-minute taxi
  to dinner.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Gastown Steam Clock\, 305 Water St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Steam Clock\, then a cab to Robson
TRIGGER:-PT20M
