BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d0-1065@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T014500Z
DTEND:20261204T030000Z
SUMMARY:Dinner: Dinesty Dumpling House
DESCRIPTION:1719 Robson St. Soup dumplings\, and the kids can watch them be
 ing made in the window. On Courtenay's guide.\n• No online reservations.
  Call to ask them to hold a table for 5\, or walk in.\n• The kitchen clo
 ses early on Thursdays\, around 8:00 to 8:30. Go early.\n• If the flight
  runs late\, Water St. Café is still held for 6:45\, three minutes from t
 he Airbnb.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Dinesty Dumpling House\, 1719 Robson St\, Vancouver\, BC V6G 1C8
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Dinner: Dinesty Dumpling House
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d0-1140@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T030000Z
DTEND:20261204T043000Z
SUMMARY:Robson Street & Robson Square
DESCRIPTION:Walk east down Robson from dinner: shops and lights for about 1
 5 minutes to Robson Square.\n• Robson Square rink: free skating\, rental
 s about $5\, usually open 9–9 from the start of December. Check that it'
 s open first.\n• From the rink it's a 15-minute walk or a short cab home
  to Gastown.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Robson Square Ice Rink\, 800 Robson St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Robson Street & Robson Square
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
