DTSTART:20261204T163000Z
DTEND:20261204T174000Z
SUMMARY:Breakfast: Nemesis Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Gastown\, 302 W Hastings St. Counter service\, four minutes fro
 m the door. The bus stop is on the way back.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/va
 ncouver/
LOCATION:Nemesis Coffee Gastown\, 302 W Hastings St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
