BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-580@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T174000Z
DTEND:20261204T193000Z
SUMMARY:Hop-on hop-off bus from Gastown
DESCRIPTION:Stop 10\, outside Lee's Donuts at 199 Water St — three minute
 s from the Airbnb. This is the first bus of the day. The full loop is abou
 t 75 minutes: Canada Place\, Robson Street\, Stanley Park\, Granville Isla
 nd\, Yaletown and back.\n• Tickets are bought and live in the Big Bus To
 urs app on Nate's phone. Tap Activate that morning and show the driver.\n
 • Hop off anywhere and catch a later bus. They pass every 30–40 minute
 s and the ticket is good all day.\n• Lunch is reserved for 11:30 at Cana
 da Place\, so the plan is to stay on for the whole loop. You're there a li
 ttle after 11.\n• Want to hop off at Stanley Park (Stop 5\, about 10:10)
 ? Call Tap & Barrel and push lunch to 12:15 first.\n• Covered double-dec
 ker in winter. Lee's Donuts opens at 8\, right at the stop.\n• If it pou
 rs\, the Vancouver Aquarium is beside the Stanley Park stop. Tickets at th
 e door\, cards only.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Lee's Donuts Gastown\, 199 Water St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Hop-on hop-off bus from Gastown
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-690@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T193000Z
DTEND:20261204T204500Z
SUMMARY:Lunch: Tap & Barrel · Convention Centre
DESCRIPTION:Table for 5 at 11:30\, reserved under Nate. At Jack Poole Plaza
 \, right beside the Market. Kids' menu\, harbour views\, seaplanes landing
  outside. Three minutes from the Canada Place bus stop.\n• The table is 
 at 11:30\, so stay on the bus for the full loop. A Stanley Park hop-off wo
 uld make you late.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Tap & Barrel Convention Centre\, 1055 Canada Place\, Vancouver\, B
 C
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Lunch: Tap & Barrel · Convention Centre
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
