DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T204500Z
DTEND:20261204T231500Z
SUMMARY:Rest at the Airbnb
DESCRIPTION:A 15-minute walk back\, a short cab\, or the bus to the Gastown
  stop. Naps\, then into the photo outfits.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vanc
 ouver/
LOCATION:Woodward's W43\, 128 West Cordova Street\, Vancouver\, BC V6B 0E6
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Rest at the Airbnb
