BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-930@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261204T233000Z
DTEND:20261205T000000Z
SUMMARY:Family photos at the Steam Clock
DESCRIPTION:Water Street\, three minutes from the door. Brick\, cobblestone
 s and lamplight look good in rain or fog\, and the clock whistles and stea
 ms on the quarter hour. Sunset is about 4:15\, so don't let it slide later
 .\n• Clear day with the mountains out? The waterfront at Jack Poole Plaz
 a\, beside the Market\, is the bonus spot.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vanc
 ouver/
LOCATION:Gastown Steam Clock\, 305 Water St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Family photos at the Steam Clock
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-965@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T000500Z
DTEND:20261205T003000Z
SUMMARY:Bus or walk to the Market
DESCRIPTION:The Big Bus stop is right there\, outside Lee's Donuts: 5 minut
 es to Canada Place on the same ticket. Or walk it in 15 minutes.\n• Buse
 s pass every 30–40 minutes; the last one leaves this stop at 5:00. Check
  the live map in the Big Bus app.\n• No bus within 10 minutes? Walk — 
 your Market slot is 4:30 to 5:00.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Lee's Donuts Gastown\, 199 Water St\, Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus or walk to the Market
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-990@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T003000Z
DTEND:20261205T021500Z
SUMMARY:Vancouver Christmas Market
DESCRIPTION:90+ huts and the 5-storey Christmas Pyramid at Jack Poole Plaza
 . Gates open at 4:00 on Fridays; that first slot sold out\, so ours is the
  4:30–5:00 arrival. The lights are on by then.\n• Tickets are bought. 
 Arrive between 4:30 and 5:00\, then stay as long as you like.\n• Santa i
 s there all evening and Elsa walks the Market from about 5:00. Karaoke sta
 rts at 7:00\, after we've left for dinner.\n• Carousel\, walk-through 35
 -foot tree\, snow showers every 30 minutes\, Santa's Workshop.\n• Kinder
 punsch for the kids\, Glühwein for the grown-ups.\n• Very little cover 
 — hoods up if it rains.\n\nhttps://popcornlove.net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Vancouver Christmas Market\, Jack Poole Plaza\, 1055 Canada Place\
 , Vancouver\, BC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Vancouver Christmas Market
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:van26-d1-1095@popcornlove.net
DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T021500Z
DTEND:20261205T023000Z
