DTSTAMP:20261128T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T233000Z
DTEND:20261206T013000Z
SUMMARY:Capilano Suspension Bridge Park - Canyon Lights
DESCRIPTION:Arrive in daylight\, stay as the lights come on around 4. Allow
  1.5–2 hours.\n• Tickets are bought and in Nate's email. Arrive betwee
 n 3:30 and 4:00\, then stay as long as you like. Sunset is about 4:15\, so
  you get the canyon in daylight and then the lights.\n• Bridge\, Cliffwa
 lk and Treetops are all lit. Ask for the kids' Activity Card (stickers →
  gingerbread house).\n• Free ponchos if it rains.\n\nhttps://popcornlove
 .net/vancouver/
LOCATION:Capilano Suspension Bridge Park\, 3735 Capilano Rd\, North Vancouv
 er\, BC V7R 4J1
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Capilano Suspension Bridge Park — Canyon Lights
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
